        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Clarify where the <style> element can be used]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44718</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44718"/>
        <updated>2026-07-14T16:13:13.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229193143?u=925b41266d876925b08ce78352f0d5d24c4a6c71&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This updates the <code class="notranslate">&lt;style&gt;</code> element documentation to clarify that the <code class="notranslate">&lt;style&gt;</code> element is not limited to the <code class="notranslate">&lt;head&gt;</code> element.</p>
<p dir="auto">The page now explains that <code class="notranslate">&lt;style&gt;</code> can be used wherever metadata content is permitted, such as inside a <code class="notranslate">&lt;template&gt;</code> element, in accordance with the HTML specification.</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #41900.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3611920061" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41900" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41900/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41900">#41900</a></p>

<h3 dir="auto">Example</h3>
<h3 dir="auto">Using <code class="notranslate">&lt;style&gt;</code> inside <code class="notranslate">&lt;template&gt;</code></h3>
<p dir="auto">The <code class="notranslate">&lt;style&gt;</code> element can also be placed inside a {{HTMLElement("template")}} element because it accepts metadata content.</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-text-html-basic notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="&lt;template id=&quot;card-template&quot;&gt;
  &lt;style&gt;
    p {
      color: rebeccapurple;
    }
  &lt;/style&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;Styled template content&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/template&gt;"><pre class="notranslate"><span class="pl-kos">&lt;</span><span class="pl-ent">template</span> <span class="pl-c1">id</span>="<span class="pl-s">card-template</span>"<span class="pl-kos">&gt;</span>
  <span class="pl-kos">&lt;</span><span class="pl-ent">style</span><span class="pl-kos">&gt;</span>
    <span class="pl-ent">p</span> {
      <span class="pl-c1">color</span><span class="pl-kos">:</span> rebeccapurple;
    }
  <span class="pl-kos">&lt;/</span><span class="pl-ent">style</span><span class="pl-kos">&gt;</span>

  <span class="pl-kos">&lt;</span><span class="pl-ent">p</span><span class="pl-kos">&gt;</span>Styled template content<span class="pl-kos">&lt;/</span><span class="pl-ent">p</span><span class="pl-kos">&gt;</span>
<span class="pl-kos">&lt;/</span><span class="pl-ent">template</span><span class="pl-kos">&gt;</span></pre></div>



]]></content>
