<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Fix inaccuracy about changing NaN sign bit</li>
<li>Add note about platform dependance in the example</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Previously this example claimed that the example code was changing the sign bit of the float, which doesn't effect NaN values.  However, the example was actually modifying the fraction component (which also doesn't affect NaN values).</p>
<p dir="auto">These changes correct that inaccuracy by being less specific about why the bit change still results in a NaN value.</p>
